#X text -393 447 IMPORTANT - Make sure before recording to set a new identifier. The identifier should match the corresponding gesture dataset for the current output. The objects to update are identified in the patch: "makefilename x-x-%04d" and "write x-x-groundtruth.json". The dataset must also be cleared using the "Clear" function identified in the patch., f 28;
#X text -393 208 Furthermore \, the path should correspond to the gesture in an interpretable way. For example \, a gesture that moves from left to right should correspond to a output path that also moves from left to right., f 28;
